{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "孩子后期可能给父母假象", "content": "很多孩子在十到18岁后半期会给父母一种假象：不想被管，想自己做判断，不想听父母啰嗦管教。很多父母因此怕管孩子，选择不管。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["假象", "独立", "管教"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-b8ac34b77e63-c001:a017", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-b8ac34b77e63", "blocks": ["b00010", "b00011"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-b8ac34b77e63-c001:a018", "kind": "supports", "condition": "十到18岁", "reason": "孩子给假象不想被管，但实际需要正确方式引导，因此父母不应放弃管教。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-b8ac34b77e63-c001:u017"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
