{"type": "concept", "subtype": "condition", "title": "父母误以为孩子应更勇敢", "content": "父母常认为十到18岁的孩子已经可以更加勇敢，受到伤害或打击后应更勇敢地爬起来，因此不太能接受孩子示弱或软弱的表现。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["勇敢", "示弱", "错误期待"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-b8ac34b77e63-c001:a021", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-b8ac34b77e63", "blocks": ["b00013"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-b8ac34b77e63-c001:a022", "kind": "supports", "condition": "十到18岁", "reason": "父母误以为孩子应更勇敢，但孩子自尊心增强且失败容忍度降低，因此更不容易勇敢。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-b8ac34b77e63-c001:u021"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "孩子自尊心增强且对失败容忍度降低", "content": "随着十到18岁孩子自尊心增强，他们对失败的容忍度反而降低，更容易觉得自己不好、很糟糕，因此更不容易勇敢地爬起来。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["自尊心", "失败容忍度", "自我评价"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-b8ac34b77e63-c001:a022", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-b8ac34b77e63", "blocks": ["b00013", "b00014"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-b8ac34b77e63-c001:a023", "kind": "causes", "condition": "十到18岁", "reason": "因为孩子失败容忍度降低，所以父母应允许示弱而非强迫坚强。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-b8ac34b77e63-c001:u022"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "允许孩子示弱而非强迫坚强", "content": "当十到18岁的孩子失败后示弱时，父母应鼓励并允许孩子示弱，而不是以故作坚强的姿态要求孩子重新站起来。同意孩子软弱比强迫孩子坚强要好得多。", "steps": ["当孩子失败后示弱时，鼓励孩子。", "允许孩子示弱，不强迫孩子坚强。"], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["示弱", "坚强", "失败"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-b8ac34b77e63-c001:a023", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-b8ac34b77e63", "blocks": ["b00014"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [], "knowledge_units": ["s-b8ac34b77e63-c001:u023"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "condition", "title": "19到25岁独立期待取决于早期教育", "content": "父母常期待19到25岁的孩子应该独立，但现实取决于以前如何教育。如果从小按照正确的方式和正常期待教育，孩子此时应是独立的个体；如果以前教得不好，此时就是“种什么收果子”的时候。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["独立", "早期教育", "结果"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-b8ac34b77e63-c001:a024", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-b8ac34b77e63", "blocks": ["b00015"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-b8ac34b77e63-c001:a025", "kind": "supports", "condition": "19到25岁", "reason": "独立和感激都取决于早期教育，因此两者相关。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-b8ac34b77e63-c001:a026", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "19到25岁", "reason": "独立期待取决于早期教育，用“种什么收果子”比喻说明。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-b8ac34b77e63-c001:u024"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
